A ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/gradual-typing.td")} approach where type annotations can be added to any subset of variables within the same code, freely mixing typed and untyped expressions.

A Gradual typing approach where type annotations can be added to **any subset of variables** within the same code, freely mixing typed and untyped expressions.
